// An M57 response without Content-Disposition, logged in the direction of the server, whose file size (473) differs from the response length (371): the response body keeps Suricata's length, and the size stays under `unmapped.fileinfo`.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_suricata
}
suricata::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
drop_null_fields
